{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A2387-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<p>在六月中，兩隻出生不久的小燕子，在巢中等待父母餵食，毛茸茸的、眼仔仍未睜開，先學懂張開嘴巴。每次父母拍翼歸來，小燕子便立即張開口，等待爸媽將捕來的昆蟲，送入口中。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A4223-1024x576.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A4217-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A4225-1024x768.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A4189-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<p>慢慢地，兩隻小燕子羽翼漸豐，開始拍動雙翼、發出吱吱的叫聲，等待父母回巢，就鬥快張開嘴，看誰會先得到餵食。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A4248-2-1024x768.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7912-1-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A4219-1024x576.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A9298-2-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7134-2-1024x768.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6312-1024x768.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6340-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A6371-1024x767.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7970-1024x684.jpeg\">\n<p>兩雙小燕子悟性不一，其中一隻較大膽，上周中期，站在巢邊，拍拍雙翼，往另一邊牆的舊鳥巢一跳、一拍翼，順利試起。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7983-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A7727-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>另一隻燕子，當日仍是留在巢內，不願起飛，仍在等待父母餵食。這一天，一家四口的燕子難得同巢共聚，但最後的一隻小燕子，當日仍不願試飛。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A0088-1024x768.jpeg\">\n<p>一日後，已學會飛行的小燕子已離巢，餘下還未願學飛的一隻，獨守燕巢。如是者又過了一日，鳥巢在上周五已空空如也，相信是最後一隻小燕子，終遲學懂了飛，離巢而去。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A0030-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T12:38:11.015075+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":19,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}